---
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Prose title="Affiliate Disclosure | All Metal Brake" description="How All Metal Brake makes money: we are a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program and may earn commissions from qualifying purchases." h1="Affiliate Disclosure">
  <p>{SITE.name} is a participant in the <strong>Amazon Services LLC Associates Program</strong>, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com. <strong>As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases.</strong></p>
  <p>When you click a "Check Price on Amazon" button or another retailer link and make a purchase, we may receive a small commission at no additional cost to you. Affiliate links are marked with <code>rel="sponsored"</code>.</p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>We also show display advertising (Google AdSense). Advertisers have no say in our content or rankings.</p>
  <h2>What This Means for Our Recommendations</h2>
  <p>Commissions pay for the site. They do not decide what we recommend. We regularly recommend cheaper products over more expensive ones, and products that earn us nothing. Read our <a href="/how-we-review/">editorial policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>Prices</h2>
  <p>Product prices and availability are accurate as of the date and time indicated on the retailer's site and are subject to change. We do not show prices; the price on the retailer's site at the time of purchase applies.</p>
</Prose>
